Typ
===

A pixel typeface.

Requirements
------------

To build the BDF file, nothing except a POSIX system is needed.

To build the TTF file, the
[bdf2ttf Python package](https://pypi.org/project/bdf2ttf/) is required.

Building
--------

To only build the BDF file, run the following:

	$ make bdf

Otherwise, just run:

	$ make

Structure
---------

The <chars> directory contains 2 main files:

- mapping: a TSV file matching each character to a raw character file.
- size: a file that only contains an integer string; this is the width and
  height of every character of the font.
